# OANDA v20 PRACTICE market data — read-only, GET-only, for the auto-paper
# worker's canonical spot feed. Never commit real tokens: put actual values in
# .env.local (which is git-ignored) or in Supabase secrets; the worker has no
# live-host variable and no order-capable interface.
OANDA_ENVIRONMENT="practice"
OANDA_ACCOUNT_ID="your-oanda-practice-account-id"
OANDA_API_TOKEN="your-oanda-practice-personal-access-token"
